source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A `\\` pair between words is its token's last run, so Jira breaks the line there; jiro reads a hard break.
-- input.jira --
a\\b
-- rendered.html --
<p>a<br class="atl-forced-newline" />b</p>
-- want.md --
a\
b
-- warnings.json --
[]
